his is so good  [Music]  how spicy if this dish were a celebrity  it would definitely be rihanna she's  tender and she's got a little heat and  then like she then once in a while  she'll surprise you like something sweet  like it was unexpected but then it all  works together this is what your dishes  are about this sums up who you are in  your food to me and i appreciate you  sharing some really insightful things  that i think i'll be able to take and  that a lot of other people will be able  to take as well i love this so that's it  here at minton's with chef jj and our  harlem adventure join us next time in  our new city on tasting our roots  you

